title: script:stop
tags: [[GUI command]] [[Scripting the GUI]]
kind: reference
summary: Stop the running script (the one asking, by default)

Stops a script the GUI started, with everything it started: `SIGTERM` to its process group, `SIGKILL` two seconds later. Without an argument, the script asking the current question — what Escape does while a question is up; with a run id (`script-3`), that one. A question nobody owns is closed instead ([[Script sessions]]).
